	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？『……アクロマめ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T13:23:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T11:16:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>？？？『……アクロマめ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T13:23:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T11:17:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・部屋に入るとメッセージ表示
　その後、主人公を自動で所定位置まで移動
・続けてswsage01_03_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-20T04:44:39" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きゃつは　かがくしゃ　として
むだに　じゅんすい　すぎる！▼
プラズマだんの
ボスに　してやったのに！▼
われわれの　イッシュせいふく　という
すうこうな　しめい　よりも▼
こじんの　きょうみを
ゆうせん　させるとは！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T13:23:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:54:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きゃつは　科学者として
無駄に　純粋すぎる！▼
プラズマ団の
ボスに　してやったのに！▼
われわれの　イッシュ征服　という
崇高な　使命よりも▼
個人の　興味を
優先させるとは！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T13:23:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:54:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・続けてswsage01_03_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-20T04:44:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:55:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さて
アナタは　こううん　です▼
ワタクシ　ゲーチスの　えんぜつを
たったひとりで　きけるのですから▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T13:26:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さて
アナタは　幸運です▼
ワタクシ　ゲーチスの　演説を
たった一人で　拝聴できるのですから▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T13:26:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・続けてswsage01_03_04</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-20T04:44:45" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>キュレムが　ひめている
ほんとうの　ちからを▼
プラズマだんの
かがくりょく・ぎじゅつりょくで▼
ピークまで　たかめ
イッシュを　こおりづけに　します！▼
きょうふに　しはいされた
イッシュの　たみ　ポケモンは▼
プラズマだんの！▼
いや　ワタクシの！
あしもとに　ふれふすのです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:53:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>キュレムが　秘めている
真の　力を▼
プラズマ団の
科学力・技術力で▼
極限まで　引きあげ
イッシュを　氷漬けに　します！▼
恐怖に　支配された
イッシュの　民　ポケモンは▼
プラズマ団の！▼
いや　ワタクシの！
足元に　ふれふすのです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T04:23:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・続けてswsage01_03_05</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-20T04:44:48" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>キュレムは　からっぽの　そんざい▼
とある　ポケモンが　レシラムと
ゼクロムに　わかれたときの　あまり……▼
ワタクシの　よくぼうは
イッシュの　かんぜんなる　しはい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:53:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>キュレムは　虚無▼
とある　ポケモンが　レシラムと
ゼクロムに　分裂したときの　余り……▼
ワタクシの　欲望は
イッシュの　完全なる　支配！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T13:28:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・続けてswsage01_03_06</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-20T04:44:52" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうです！　キュレムという　うつわに
ワタクシの　よくぼうを　そそぐのです！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:53:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうです！　キュレムという　器に
ワタクシの　欲望を　注ぐのです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:53:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・続けてninja1_03_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T08:20:01" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
